### Netcup SCP API — Snapshots
# Snapshot lifecycle management.

### List Snapshots
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/snapshots
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Create Snapshot (async — returns task UUID)
# name is required; diskName and onlineSnapshot are optional
POST {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/snapshots
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "pre-update-snapshot",
  "description": null,
  "diskName": null,
  "onlineSnapshot": false
}

### Delete Snapshot (async — returns task UUID)
DELETE {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/snapshots/REPLACE_WITH_SNAPSHOT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Revert to Snapshot (async — returns task UUID)
POST {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/snapshots/REPLACE_WITH_SNAPSHOT_ID:revert
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Export Snapshot (async — returns task UUID)
POST {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/snapshots/REPLACE_WITH_SNAPSHOT_ID:export
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Dry Run — Check if Snapshot is Possible
# Returns validation result without creating a snapshot
POST {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/snapshots:dryrun
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "diskName": "vda",
  "onlineSnapshot": false
}
